<h1>
GREAT (Green Retrofit Evidence-grounded Agent Team): Benchmarking Multi-agent RAG System for Green Retrofit Planning
</h1>

<p class="lead">
<h2>Adam Smith’s “Division of Labour” principle in 3 human-AI decision system configurations</h2>
<ul>
<li>Case 1: a generic LLM with no prior domain knowledge (imagine a junior staff managing a company)</li>
<li>Case 2: a single-agent system with 1 big RAG corpus (imagine a boss running the company as a one-man-band)</li>
<li>Case 3: a multi-agent system with specific RAG corpora (imagine a team of experts collaborating in a company and sometimes arguing with each other)</li>
</ul>

<h2>How GREAT works</h2>
